  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSFORMING LANN+ TO NUTRITION SMART COMMUNITIES DCD 35432 SLE.WHH.2024.01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project directly targets 2,460 households and indirectly reaches a total population of 49,985 in Pujehun and 78,276 in Port Loko districts and tackles maternal and child malnutrition through systematic screening and the LANN+ approach (Linking Agriculture, Nutrition and Natural resource management) which combines nutrition education; nutrition-sensitive agriculture; sustainable natural resources management; nutrition-sensitive WASH, income generation and market linkages.</narrative>
  </description>
